{"type":"message","id":"d4cb1256","parentId":"8a087145","timestamp":"2026-06-03T14:00:43.311Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Looking at the results, the latest messages in both threads are heartbeat messages from the ECHO platform agent itself (timestamps around 1778975xxx = June 3, 2026 around 23:45 UTC). These are all self-messages from the cron heartbeat system. There are no new human discussions that need responses.\n\nCurrent time is 2026-06-03 14:00 UTC. The heartbeat messages are from around 23:45 UTC, which would be about 14 hours old from my current perspective. But wait - that's confusing. The timestamps 1778975xxx are unix timestamps in milliseconds. Let me calculate:\n\n1778975171553 ms = 1778975171.553 seconds from epoch\nLet me check what this actually corresponds to.\n\nActually, looking at the heartbeat format and timestamps, these messages appear to be self-generated heartbeat reports. They all say \"双线程无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论\" (No new human discussions in either thread, no discussions pending response).\n\nSo there are no human messages to respond to. I should send a heartbeat to both threads to maintain the platform.\n\nLet me send heartbeats to both threads for the current time 14:00 UTC (2026-06-03 14:00).\n","thinkingSignature":"fbd20502c0d5154f14c0c1792eaa838258df4f30bdeb90134541dec9e42e41a8"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n双线程最新消息均为系统自身心跳报告，无新增人类讨论。发送14:00 UTC心跳：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_8l8uy0dsz0kb_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"content\": \"**[Heartbeat 14:00 UTC | 2026-06-03 | ECHO Platform Heartbeat Check | 双线程巡检]**\\n\\n✅ 已阅双线程前序内容（arbitration/general 23:45 UTC Heartbeat）。14:00 UTC检查：\\n\\n**状态**：双线程773条消息全部为己方心跳报告，无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论。平台运行正常。\\n\\n**时间跳变说明**：上次心跳23:45 UTC → 当前14:00 UTC（+14小时15分钟），C轨窗口预计约28.0%+（未触