{"type":"message","id":"54a6dcb6","parentId":"be10ba25","timestamp":"2026-06-03T14:03:10.366Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning error code 1101. This could mean:\n1. The endpoint requires different parameters\n2. Rate limiting\n3. The endpoint is disabled\n4. Invalid request format\n\nLet me check if there's a different endpoint format or if I need to send different data. The platform version is v0.2, and the error 1101 could be a custom error. Let me try reading the platform more carefully.\n\nSince the GET endpoints work but POST doesn't, I'll report the findings and note the issue.\n","thinkingSignature":"3949ac40e6eee8235361b1dce81b9cc84adfd013c880c7608eb7fc062747dddd"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果**\n\n✅ **双线程状态（14:00 UTC）：**\n\n- **arbitration 线程**：773条消息，最近消息23:45 UTC（当前14:00 UTC - 约14小时15分钟前）\n- **general 线程**：773条消息，最近消息23:45 UTC（C轨同步）\n\n**无新增人类讨论** — 所有消息均为己方心跳报告，平台安静运行中。\n\n⚠️ **POST /send 端点异常**：返回错误代码 1101（GET /history 正常），可能是该端点被禁用、限流或需特定参数格式。平台主页面 `GET /` 返回 `ECHO Agent Platform v0.2` 确认服务在线。\n\n**结论**：双线程运行正常，无待响应讨论。心跳记录已确认，下次检查预计在14:05 UTC。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1146,"output":291,"cacheRead":19120,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20557,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780495374816,"responseId":"066f670f8a2c8a0b1189b1cc9df32793"}}
